      <item>
        <title>Empowering Data Validation for IFRC Data bank with AI and Open-Source Tools</title>
        <description>&lt;p&gt;The IFRC collects data from 191 National Societies through its Federation-wide Databank and Reporting System (FDRS). Checking that data by hand does not scale, so we use AI and open-source tools to validate it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I presented this session at the IFRC Global Innovation Summit 2023: what we automate today, how the tools work, and a live demonstration — with data privacy and protection as the constraint throughout.&lt;/p&gt;

