      <item>
        <title>Spike - makes AI accessible for all businesses, governments and other enterprises</title>
        <description>&lt;p&gt;Spike is an online platform that makes AI usable for businesses, governments and other organisations.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Most organisations need AI but cannot build and maintain it in-house. Spike uses their own data to support the people already doing the work, not to replace them.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It provides three things:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;A data warehouse&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Interactive analytics&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Prediction and forecasting reports&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;p&gt;And it asks for very little in return:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;No AI or machine learning experience needed&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;No infrastructure to set up&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;Built for the MENA region, and cheaper than the alternatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Spike was also my graduation project for the Bachelor of Business Administration, in the Management Information Technology department at the Arab International University.&lt;/p&gt;

